# <type>(<scope>): imperative summary, max 72 chars
#
# Why: what was broken or missing, and why this approach.
#      Not a restatement of the diff.
#
# Tested: exactly what you ran and what you observed.
#         If something was not tested, say so.
#
# Trailers (leave one blank line above them):
#   Assisted-by: <tool> (<model>)
#   Closes #<issue>
#
# Types: feat fix refactor docs test ci chore perf
#
# Lines starting with '#' are ignored.
